// Demo dataset: a software vendor selling a CRM suite. Eight accounts in different
// shapes (a group with a subsidiary, three prospects, a partner), a pipeline with deals
// in every stage — including two won and one lost, so the forecast and the win/loss
// analysis have something to say — plus quotes, contracts, orders, installed assets,
// support entitlements, open cases and the activity trail behind all of it.
//
// Seed ids are model-local aliases used to wire the records together; the database
// assigns the real numeric ids and works out the insertion order from the relations.
// Calculated fields (probability, expected revenue, line totals, rollups) are never
// seeded — the database computes them.
